<p>Calls forth a ray of light from the Sun, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">134, 180, 216, 246, 273</acronym> Light damage to the target.</p><p>At level 3 the ray will be so intense it will also blind the target and everyone in a radius 2 around it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage dealt will increase with your Spellpower.</p>